## Task 2 — Navigate directories and practise autocompletion

- `pwd` showed my location, `cd ~` took me to `/root`, and `ls -la` listed all entries including hidden ones such as `.bashrc`, `.config` and `.cache`.
- I created `shell-practice` with `mkdir`, entered it with `cd`, and `pwd` confirmed `/root/shell-practice`.
